        "summary": "List customer inventory telephone numbers.",
        "description": "Returns a list of customer inventory telephone numbers that are available for subscription.\n\nYou must pass the <code>x-customer-number</code> parameter in the header to complete this call successfully. For this endpoint, the <code>x-customer-number</code> is the same as your <strong>Parent BusOrg</strong> ID.\n\n__Note:__ If no telephone numbers are available in the query, the __tnResults__ returns an empty array. See the example response below.\n\n```\n{\n  \"rateCenter\": \"DENVER\",\n  \"state\": \"CO\",\n  \"tnResults\": [],\n  \"pendingVoidListResult\": {\n  \"voiceOrderIds\":[],\n  \"description\": \"\"\n        }\n}\n```\n",
