    "/Voice/v2/Numbers/coverage": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Coverage"
        ],
        "summary": "Retrieve service availability (V2).",
        "description": "Returns service availability information for new or porting telephone numbers.\n\n__Note:__\n\n- You can look for service coverage using only the address when __lnpIndicator=\"N\"__. Local Inbound (LI) customers may use only a telephone number when checking for portability and __lnpIndicator=\"Y\"__.\n- If you check coverage for multiple telephone numbers simultaneously, and a single TN fails the coverage check, the whole request will fail.\n- If you check coverage for multiple telephone numbers simultaneously and the request is successful, the returned <code>earliestCRD</code> and <code>latestCRD</code> dates will apply to all of the telephone numbers passed in the request.\n\n<br>\n\n__Required fields based on the type of availability check:__\n\n__Address Check__\n```\ncustomerServiceName\nlnpIndicator = \"N\"\nproductID\ne911Option\nserviceAddress\n```\n\n__Enhanced Local Service (ELS) Portability Check__\n```\ncustomerServiceName\nlnpIndicator = \"Y\"\nproductID\ne911Option\nserviceAddress\ntnList\n\nNote: The \"tnList\" field is for Local Number Portability (LNP) orders only.\nMultiple telephone numbers (tn) on the same address can be checked at a time.\n```\n\n\n__Local Inbound (LI)  Portability Check__\n```\ncustomerServiceName\nlnpIndicator = \"Y\"\nproductID\ne911Option = \"E_911_CUSTOMER_PROVIDED\"\ntnList\n\nNote: The \"tnList\" field is for Local Number Portability (LNP) orders only.\nOnly one telephone number (tn) can be checked at a time.\n```\n",
        "operationId": "coverageCheckUsingPOST",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-customer-number",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "Lumen defined customer ID. Also known as BusOrg number",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "1-ABCDE"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "payload",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CoverageRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "*/*": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CoverageCheckResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "You are not authorized to view the resource"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Accessing the resource you were trying to reach is forbidden."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The resource you were trying to reach was not found."
          }
        },
        "deprecated": false,
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
