    "/Voice/v2/Numbers/order": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Orders"
        ],
        "summary": "Create an install or porting order.",
        "description": "Creates an order to install Local Inbound (LI) and Enhanced Local Service (ELS) telephone numbers from your inventory or to order Local Number Portability (LNP) for LI and ELS products.\n\nYou must pass the <code>x-customer-number</code> parameter in the header to complete this call successfully. For this endpoint, the <code>x-customer-number</code> is the same as your <strong>Child BusOrg</strong> ID or the BusOrg assigned to the billing account number (BAN).\n\n<br>\n\n#### Order configuration options\n\nWhen making your request, the __ProductFeatureList__ and __orderMappingList__ arrays are a required group of name-value pairs. Required fields and order mapping name-value pairs will vary based on your chosen order configuration option. Listed below are the four order configuration options:\n\n<br>\n\n##### __Option 1: Local Number Portability (LNP) for Enhanced Local Service (ELS) products__ \n\n<details>\n<summary>Click to view the required fields and ProductFeatureList array for option 1</summary>\n\n__Required fields:__\n```\nproductID\nlnpIndicator\nsubscriberLineList\n```\n\nIf you are placing an order to install LNP for ELS products, the following name-value pairs are required in the __ProductFeatureList__ array.\n\n\n```\n\"ProductFeatureList\": [\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerServiceName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"billingTelephoneNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedAddress\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListAction\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"R\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedStreetNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedStreetName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedCity\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },            \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedState\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedZipCode\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },            \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryBusinessName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryFirstName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryLastName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListType\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"autoPortYn\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },            \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"autoPortTime\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },            \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loaAuthName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loa\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"Y\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loaDateTime\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierAccountNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierPin\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierWirelessLNP\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"blockCustomerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"comments\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    }            \n  ]    \n```\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n##### __Option 2: Local Number Portability (LNP) for Local Inbound (LI) products__\n\n<details>\n<summary>Click to view the required fields and ProductFeatureList array for option 2</summary>\n\n__Required fields:__\n```\nproductID\nlnpIndicator\nsubscriberLineList\n```\n\nIf you are placing an order to install LNP for LI products, the following name-value pairs are required in the __ProductFeatureList__ array.\n\n```\n\"ProductFeatureList\": [\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerServiceName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"billingTelephoneNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"addCnamYn\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"autoPortYn\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },            \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"autoPortTime\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },                          \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loaAuthName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loa\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"Y\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"loaDateTime\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierAccountNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierPin\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"losingCarrierWirelessLNP\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerRequestedDate\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },              \n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"comments\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    }              \n  ]    \n```\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n##### __Option 3: New Enhanced Local Service (ELS) telephone numbers__\n\n<details>\n<summary>Click to view the required fields and orderMappingList array for option 3</summary>\n\n__Required fields:__\n```\nproductID\nlnpIndicator\nsubscriberLineList\ne911Option\n```\n\nIf you are placing an order to install new ELS telephone numbers, the following name-value pairs are required in the __orderMappingList__ array.\n\n```\n\"orderMappingList\": [\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerServiceName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"billingTelephoneNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListAction\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"A\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedStreetNumber\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedStreetName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListedState\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryBusinessName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryFirstName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryLastName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"directoryListType\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"blockCustomerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnQuantity\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocNpa\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n                {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocNxx \",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocCity\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocCty\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocState\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocZip\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    }                                              \n  ]    \n```\n<br>\n\n__Note:__\n\n- You must specify the __tnLocNpa__ and __tnLocNxx__ attributes to order by NXX. Each __attributeValue__ must have a length of three.\n\n- You must specify the __tnLocCity__, __tnLocCty__, __tnLocState__, and __tnLocZip__ attributes to order by location. The __attributeValue__ for __tnLocZip__ must be a length of five.\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n\n##### __Option 4: New Local Inbound (LI) telephone numbers__\n\n<details>\n<summary>Click to view the required fields and orderMappingList array for option 4</summary>\n\n__Required fields:__\n```\nproductID\nlnpIndicator\nsubscriberLineList\n```\n\nIf you are placing an order to install new LI telephone numbers, the following name-value pairs are required in the __orderMappingList__ array.\n\n```\n\"orderMappingList\": [\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerServiceName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"blockCustomerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"customerName\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnQuantity\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocNpa\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocNxx \",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocCity\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocCty\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocState\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n       \"attributeName\": \"tnLocZip\",\n       \"attributeValue\": \"\"\n    } \n  ]    \n```\n<br>\n\n__Note:__\n\n- You must specify the __tnLocNpa__ and __tnLocNxx__ attributes to order by NXX. Each __attributeValue__ must have a length of three.\n\n- You must specify the __tnLocCity__, __tnLocCty__, __tnLocState__, and __tnLocZip__ attributes to order by location. The __attributeValue__ for __tnLocZip__ must be a length of five.\n</details>\n",
        "operationId": "installOrderUsingPOST",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-customer-number",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "customer number assigned by Lumen, also known as the BusOrg number.",
            "required": false,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "1-ABCDE"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "tnOrderRequest",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommonTNOrderRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted for processing.",
            "content": {
              "*/*": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VoiceOrder"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "You are not authorized to view the resource."
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "The resource you created does not meet the data requirement(s)."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Accessing the resource you were trying to reach is forbidden."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The resource you were trying to reach was not found."
          }
        },
        "deprecated": false,
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/Voice/v2/Numbers/order/supplement": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Porting"
        ],
        "summary": "Supplement a porting order.",
        "description": "Submits new information for a pending Local Number Portability (LNP) order with the given __voiceOrderID__.\n\n__Required fields:__\n\n```\nvoiceOrderID\nparentTransactionID\nsubscriber\n\nNote: Include the \"subscriber\" array in your request even if the \"serviceAddress\" is NULL.\nBefore FOC you can submit changes to any field after FOC you can only make changes to the following :\ncustomerRequestedDate\nexternalOrderID\nSubscriber\n    Add subscriber TN\n    Add billingTelephoneNumber\n    Remove a TN as a SUPP after FOC\n```\n\nIn your request, you can supplement information for the following fields:\n```\ncustomerRequestedDate\nexternalOrderID\nbillingTelephoneNumber\nsubscriber\n```\n\n__Note:__ The latest you can request a supplement order is by 11:00 PM GMT, one business day before the Firm Order Commit (FOC) date.\n",
        "operationId": "supplementOrdeUsingPOST",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-customer-number",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "customer number assigned by Lumen, also known as the BusOrg number.",
            "required": false,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "1-ABCDE"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "supplementOrderRequest",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TNSupplementRequestNew"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted for processing.",
            "content": {
              "*/*": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VoiceOrder"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "You are not authorized to view the resource."
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "The resource you created does not meet the data requirement(s)."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Accessing the resource you were trying to reach is forbidden."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The resource you were trying to reach was not found."
